BGWiki.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\">Outer City</a></span> for room and board.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Join the <a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Fist\" title=\"Flaming Fist\">Flaming Fist</a>.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Try not to strangle <a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\">Rolan</a>.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202111\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2046/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31452/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7603/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936674/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.752      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   49.752      1 -total\n 56.52%   28.119      9 Template:Icon_text\n 49.96%   24.854     21 Template:Trim\n 21.82%   10.854      2 Template:Uid\n 17.32%    8.615      4 Template:Icon_link\n 15.09%    7.506      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.73%    5.834      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.15%    5.049      9 Template:Ifempty\n  9.42%    4.687      2 Template:CharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12601-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202111 and revision id 365575. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}